            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I never noticed that icons were also small in my `cmp` popup menus. I think I was too enamored with the faux transparency to notice. All of this stems from me enabling `extra_ui` in `mini.basics`. I've disabled while I determine what I like better: big icons or faux transparency? 😄 ",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I never noticed that icons were also small in my <code class=\"notranslate\">cmp</code> popup menus. I think I was too enamored with the faux transparency to notice. All of this stems from me enabling <code class=\"notranslate\">extra_ui</code> in <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.basics</code>. I've disabled while I determine what I like better: big icons or faux transparency? 😄</p>",
            "bodyText": "I never noticed that icons were also small in my cmp popup menus. I think I was too enamored with the faux transparency to notice. All of this stems from me enabling extra_ui in mini.basics. I've disabled while I determine what I like better: big icons or faux transparency? 😄",
